# Local working docs and tooling — not part of the published project.
docs/
AGENTS.md
# .claude/ is local tooling, EXCEPT the project design system, which is a real
# deliverable. Note the pattern: you cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is itself excluded, because git never descends into it. So each
# level excludes its CONTENTS (`dir/*`) and then re-includes the one child we
# want. `.claude/` with a trailing slash would make the negations below dead.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/trainer-design/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.MD
tmp-*.ts
